  "description": "<p><em>Artefact (a withered eye, pressed into an empty socket).</em> You have Truesight <strong>60ft</strong>. Once per day each: <em>clairaudience/clairvoyance</em>, <em>dominate person</em>, <em>eyebite</em>, <em>disintegrate</em>.</p><p><strong>Drawback:</strong> putting it in costs you an eye for good, and each use of a power triggers a Corruption roll (Sorcerer&#x27;s Corruption), as if you were a Sorcerer.</p><p><strong>Destroyed:</strong> together with the Hand, by the one who made both.</p><p class=\"arn-note\">Monsters &amp; Treasure, Artefacts. Its save DC is 20 unless the entry says otherwise.</p>",
